Materials: any scrap yarn, size H hook

-- Recursion with a real base case: this is what makes Yarn Turing-complete.
-- "hook" peeks the top of the loop stack without popping it, so the
-- condition can be checked before deciding whether to recurse again.

Special Stitch: countdown
  -- base case: the 0 gets dropped and we stop
  if hook = 0
    sl st
  otherwise
    -- print the running count, then recurse on n - 1
    inc, snip, ch 1, dec, countdown
  end if.
End special stitch.

Row 1: ch 5
Row 2: countdown
FO
